			  "headline": "Citi downgrades US stocks to 'neutral' as AI sell-off, regulatory risks mount",
			  "description": "Citigroup strategists have downgraded US equities to neutral due to ongoing market volatility and regulatory concerns. This decision follows a significant sell-off that erased $3 trillion from the market value of S&P 500 companies. The strategists expressed worries about the potential for key indices like Nasdaq to shift into net-short territory. They also adjusted global and European technology sector ratings to neutral while upgrading healthcare stocks.",
